  "description": "Drop-in SaaS licensing for any .NET app (Console, ASP.NET Core, WinForms, WPF).\n      Validates licenses against a self-hostable Tollgate server, caches them\n      encrypted on disk, and gates features via [RequireFeature] / [RequireTier]\n      attributes. Cryptographically verified offline cache with grace period,\n      cross-platform machine fingerprinting.",
